Stampede3 fleet marker for build_static_bundle.sh / rpm %build.

Opt-in only:
  - Created by scripts/prepare_rpmbuild_stampede3.sh (never commit this file).
  - Embedded in the dist tarball via dist-hook when the file exists at make dist time.
  - Or set HPCS_BUNDLE_FLEET=stampede3 for the prepare/build host.

Default prepare_rpmbuild_dirs.sh must not require or ship stampede3.force.
